# Conformance probe pack for `with` (spec 0.18) on a sequential `bits`
# layout, most significant bit first: an `fx` presence and a chain. Public.
# No kinds. y is mapped by no line of this pack.
#
#   presence f fx   f.1: z with y
#   chain           c1, then an fx bit, then c2 with y
#
# A suppressed line is not content for an fx presence bit nor for the fx bit
# of a chain (ruling 1).
format     conformance-cond-chain
version    0.18.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
presence f fx
if f.1
  field probe.z  8  uint  with probe.y
end
chain
  field probe.c1  8  uint
  fx
  field probe.c2  8  uint  with probe.y
end
